# Update Contact Roles
### Request Details
#### Sample Request
```curl
Copiedcurl "https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Contacts/roles"
-X PUT
-d "@updatecontactroles.json"
-H "Authorization: Zoho-oauthtoken 1000.8cb99dxxxxxxxxxxxxx9be93.9b8xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxf"
```

